commit 6288994b593ab47fda0554a35deaec2c71a10a0b
Author: acb6 <cxylhtgzs@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Sep 27 18:18:20 2026 +0800

    Implement ESKF15 navigation, readiness and sensor contracts
    
    Add bounded GNSS quality and consistency weighting, effective-fusion health,
    transactional body-history ESKF15 replay, generated configuration and exact log
    evidence. Gate START on current navigation preparation and publish AIR health.
    
    Add selected-only IMU and UBX drivers with readback and explicit persistence,
    including qualified BMI088 synchronized acquisition. Preserve logger admission,
    storage integrity and existing firmware resource limits.
    
    Record six generated firmware configurations, real Host/storage verification,
    five-log analysis and offline product evidence. New hardware remains unverified;
    no flashing, physical output or release is included.

